---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="High-Converting Copywriting Frameworks for B2B SaaS & E-Commerce | PixelPage Blog"
  description="Explore PAS, AIDA, and Direct-Response frameworks tuned specifically for modern AI landing page copy generation and A/B test variant creation."
>
  <Nav />
  <main class="pt-32 pb-24 bg-[#0d0d14]">
    <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mb-8">
        <a href="/blog" class="text-xs font-semibold text-violet-400 hover:text-violet-300 flex items-center gap-1 mb-4">
          <span>← Back to Blog Overview</span>
        </a>
        <span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-fuchsia-500/20 text-fuchsia-300 border border-fuchsia-500/30">
          Conversion Optimization
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mt-4 mb-4 leading-tight font-sans">
          High-Converting Copywriting Frameworks for B2B SaaS & E-Commerce
        </h1>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-xs text-gray-400 pb-6 border-b border-white/10">
          <span>By Direct Response Copywriters</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>July 14, 2026</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>6 min read</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6 text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        <p class="text-base text-gray-200 leading-relaxed font-semibold">
          Design attracts attention, but copy turns visitors into paying customers. The key to high conversion rates lies in using battle-tested direct-response frameworks.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight pt-4">1. The PAS Framework (Problem, Agitate, Solution)</h2>
        <p>
          The PAS framework is exceptionally effective for B2B SaaS and high-ticket service offers:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-300">
          <li><strong>Problem:</strong> Identify the core pain point your target customer experiences daily.</li>
          <li><strong>Agitate:</strong> Highlight the costs and frustrations of leaving the problem unsolved.</li>
          <li><strong>Solution:</strong> Introduce your product as the clear, frictionless relief.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight pt-4">2. Instant A/B Testing with AI Copy Variants</h2>
        <p>
          Testing headlines is the single highest-leverage lever in conversion rate optimization. PixelPage automatically generates Variant A (Benefit-focused) and Variant B (Social Proof & Urgency-focused) so you can split test campaign messaging immediately upon launch.
        </p>

        <div class="pt-8 border-t border-white/10 mt-12 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Generate high-converting copy in seconds</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">Let AI copywriters craft on-brand landing page messaging.</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/chat" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-600 to-fuchsia-500 text-white shadow-lg">
            Start Generating Free →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
